{"text":"as being different, but they're exactly the same. And I must ultimately trust that my life has equipped me with all the tools and weapons I need to deal with them. Your life is equipping you now with all you need to slay your dragons and realize your dreams and goals. More and more women today are coming alive, diversifying their career paths, defying the narrow expectations the world has in place for them. We continue to fight for equality, for justice, for freedom, for compassion. And we achieve the most when we are awakened and responsive to the desires of our individual hearts. It is then that we can really be a part of a whole and share our tools to fulfill the bigger picture of a better tomorrow.","words":[{"text":"as","start":0.9,"end":1.54},{"text":"being","start":1.54,"end":2.18},{"text":"different","start":2.18,"end":2.72,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":2.98,"end":3.08},{"text":"they're","start":3.08,"end":3.34},{"text":"exactly","start":3.34,"end":3.84},{"text":"the","start":3.84,"end":4.42},{"text":"same","start":4.42,"end":4.9,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":5.84,"end":6.04},{"text":"I","start":6.04,"end":6.34},{"text":"must","start":6.34,"end":6.76},{"text":"ultimately","start":6.76,"end":7.48},{"text":"trust","start":7.48,"end":7.94},{"text":"that","start":7.94,"end":8.18},{"text":"my","start":8.18,"end":8.4},{"text":"life","start":8.4,"end":8.72},{"text":"has","start":8.72,"end":8.92},{"text":"equipped","start":8.92,"end":9.3},{"text":"me","start":9.3,"end":9.66},{"text":"with","start":9.66,"end":9.94},{"text":"all","start":9.94,"end":10.22},{"text":"the","start":10.22,"end":10.38},{"text":"tools","start":10.38,"end":10.82},{"text":"and","start":10.82,"end":11.04},{"text":"weapons","start":11.04,"end":11.5},{"text":"I","start":11.5,"end":12.02},{"text":"need","start":12.02,"end":12.32},{"text":"to","start":12.32,"end":12.6},{"text":"deal","start":12.6,"end":12.82},{"text":"with","start":12.82,"end":13.06},{"text":"them","start":13.06,"